{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Fizz Flow demo includes around limited content of the game. Factory size, machine types and the storage volume are some of the limitations in this demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We always aim to improve upon your feedback. The demo will be updated with completed new features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please join our Discord server with in-game menu and leave your thoughts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join among the beverage Kings of old America!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fizz Flow is a strategy and management game that takes place in a setting without competition regulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In old America, where the beverage industry is on the rise, embark on an adventure to make a name for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own factory,\u00a0 make your own unique recipes, manage your flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647080/extras/Fizz_Flow_Customization_v2.gif?t=1745411829\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Optimise your factory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimize production by managing your workers, managers, raw material supply, and machines. Please your customers and preserve your relations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647080/extras/Fizz_Flow_Factory_Management_Machine_Replacement_3.gif?t=1745411829\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Think like a real boss!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A shrewd businessman who turns crises into advantage? A visionary boss who ignores details and dreams big? Live in the moment or invest in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647080/extras/Fizz_Flow__Factory_Management_Worker_Screen_3.gif?t=1745411829\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take over the Industry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own recipes and produce the products demanded in the market! Capture the market and become the leader of the industry. Crown your production adventure that started in a small workshop, with a giant factory with the latest technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647080/extras/Fizz_Flow__Factory_Management_Contract_v3.gif?t=1745411829\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plan, Improve, Grow</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your factory and design it to the most efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy new machines, modify them and increase your productive power and conduct research to increase your production power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up new production lines for the ever-changing market. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ahead of the market by being the first to research new types of drinks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your workers and managers, and outshine your competitors with the best teams.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647080/extras/Fizz_Flow_Factory_Management_Crowded_Factory_v2.gif?t=1745411829\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy Gameplay, Never Without Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to set things right at the factory over a hot cup of coffee? This game is cozy but factory management is hard. Manage time, resources, production and workers, satisfy your customers, hold your place in the ever-changing industry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647080/0507d9618524baa44416f2a0dc1cd09f32c467f9.jpg"},{"name":"Let Production Begin!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647080/d89686662538a0c6cd6723c21334724a4235028a.jpg"},{"name":"Hygiene Matters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647080/2789d9432b71d8b95435ed6f1d272f6028c9a360.jpg"},{"name":"First Collapse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647080/3a56b420c153e2895c8ffadefcc5fae578f758f5.jpg"},{"name":"First Downfall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647080/78df2ae362e3923ac36d35c29a394fef43343744.jpg"},{"name":"First Step to Success","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647080/87d242eff6579205ce112b67ba88a19f5ba0b0dd.jpg"},{"name":"First Discovery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647080/9bec0fbce5eedeb32158cdea6c83784f918d6c95.jpg"},{"name":"Guided by Science","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647080/6e1a2e6cd52a81938df115844953a412d52a8517.jpg"},{"name":"Survive 5 Days","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647080/12fe3dd40667439f78c3992d17c14d75d17a7d14.jpg"},{"name":"Survive 7 Days","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3647080/8df168f010720e80987caff40a4eb5d8307c1c2b.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647080?t=1745411829","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647080?t=1745411829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co